  "next24": "<ul><li>Commence disassembly of lower SBOP for packing element replacement.</li><li>Open all BOP stack doors and remove ram blocks.</li><li>NOV FSE to continue overhaul of 14 Inch U2B door assembly.</li><li>Continue recording spare part traceability information for parts to be used during this BWM.</li><li>Rig welders continue to remove BOP HPU fluid recovery unit tank / skid.<br></li></ul>",
  "summary24": "<ul><li>Completed pulling riser / BOP to surface - BOP in splash zone at 03.00hrs.</li><li>Tied back and secured all moonpool drape hose and service lines to allow BOP set back on the BOP cart at WC.</li><li>Rigged down rig floor RHE / rigged up BOP jetting sub and completed jetting of the BOP stack bore at WC.</li><li>Skidded BOP back to moonpool set back area, connected the BOP crane and moved the BOP to the starboard set back area and completed  wellhead connector cleaning and inspection.</li><li>Transferred the BOP to the port set back area and latched the BOP to the fixed test stump.</li><li>Disconnected the LMRP from the lower stack and transferred the LMRP to the starboard setback area.</li><li>Completed disassembly / cleaning and inspection of the diverter insert spool for flowline seals and packing element replacement / BWM CBM tasks.</li><li>Commenced re-assembly of the diverter insert spool.</li><li>NOV FSE completed spare 14\" U2B Door components inspections and commenced re-assembly of the door.</li><li>Technical department continued removal of the BOP HPU fluid recovery unit tank and piping.<br></li></ul>",
